WEBVTT

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:02.814
Kiritsubo.

00:00:02.814 --> 00:00:03.615
Sir?

00:00:03.615 --> 00:00:08.753
Even now, you insist that
The Children are safe?

00:00:08.753 --> 00:00:09.521
Yes.

00:00:09.521 --> 00:00:13.548
They're still just children and
little mischievous, but...

00:00:13.625 --> 00:00:15.727
That's not what we're discussing.

00:00:15.727 --> 00:00:18.821
It's the future that we in the government fear.

00:00:19.164 --> 00:00:20.028
Look at this!

00:00:20.999 --> 00:00:24.935
The devil probability has climbed
15% in barely two months time!

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:27.405
But the angel probability has
drastically increased as well...

00:00:27.405 --> 00:00:30.602
Aside from that, there's this photo.
Data analysis shows...

00:00:33.745 --> 00:00:38.239
that there is a 92% probability that it shows
Kaoru Akashi 10 years from now.

00:00:38.683 --> 00:00:40.480
What's that smoke in the background?

00:00:40.552 --> 00:00:42.952
And why did Hyobu Kyosuke have it?!

00:00:43.254 --> 00:00:44.422
Unknown.

00:00:44.422 --> 00:00:47.158
In any case, The Children are national treasures!

00:00:47.158 --> 00:00:51.229
No, at this rate, they're turning from
national treasures into a national threat.

00:00:51.229 --> 00:00:52.864
Th-Threat?

00:00:52.864 --> 00:00:56.356
Then you're saying that we
don't need Level 7 espers?!

00:00:56.701 --> 00:00:58.259
Who cares what this graph shows?!

00:00:58.803 --> 00:01:02.507
We have to protect those girls! Believe in them!

00:01:02.507 --> 00:01:04.737
I believe that's directly linked
to changing the future!

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:07.235
Excuse me. May I say something?

00:01:08.179 --> 00:01:10.849
There's no point in debating it like this.

00:01:10.849 --> 00:01:11.983
Besides...

00:01:11.983 --> 00:01:17.319
What if I proved to you that The Children
are a benefit to this nation?

00:01:18.523 --> 00:01:21.117
If I do that, you'd have no complaints, surely.

00:01:21.826 --> 00:01:22.315
Right?

00:01:24.696 --> 00:01:26.129
Prove?

00:01:27.499 --> 00:01:34.598
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:01:35.607 --> 00:01:41.477
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:43.915 --> 00:01:49.717
Meeting you like I did

00:01:50.055 --> 00:01:54.924
Wasn't just so we could live

00:01:56.194 --> 00:02:01.723
Tiny wishes, cross through time

00:02:02.133 --> 00:02:06.729
And surely change the future

00:02:07.338 --> 00:02:10.241
When my limiter (changing myself)

00:02:10.241 --> 00:02:13.369
Is released (changing yourself)

00:02:13.511 --> 00:02:19.245
An angel's shining surges through me

00:02:20.685 --> 00:02:23.254
The "wings" that will save the world

00:02:23.254 --> 00:02:26.087
Now I'm on the path I chose

00:02:26.324 --> 00:02:32.490
And I want to grab my dreams (Can't stop)

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:35.433
The power given to me

00:02:35.433 --> 00:02:38.069
Spurs me into the sky

00:02:38.069 --> 00:02:43.803
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:02:44.142 --> 00:02:49.671
Absolutely lovely, my wings

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:01.359
Wow! It's pouring!

00:03:01.359 --> 00:03:03.061
The forecast was totally wrong.

00:03:03.061 --> 00:03:05.063
Let's wait for Mr. Minamoto to pick us up.

00:03:05.063 --> 00:03:06.764
It's okay. My house is close, so...

00:03:06.764 --> 00:03:08.933
But we go the same way.

00:03:08.933 --> 00:03:10.161
Okay, but I'll hold the umbrella.

00:03:10.568 --> 00:03:11.803
Sharing an umbrella!

00:03:11.803 --> 00:03:13.404
Meeting us with one!

00:03:13.404 --> 00:03:14.939
That wouldn't be so bad.

00:03:14.939 --> 00:03:17.308
But he's coming in a car, right?

00:03:17.308 --> 00:03:18.400
Oh. Right.

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:20.974
Darn it, what's the point, then?

00:03:29.954 --> 00:03:32.821
I've come to meet you, Princess Children.

00:03:35.059 --> 00:03:36.253
An elephant?!

00:03:38.463 --> 00:03:40.988
Your Majesty, what are you doing?!

00:03:42.433 --> 00:03:43.401
41st sense:
"Marital Vows! His Majesty's Children!"

00:03:43.401 --> 00:03:44.459
41st sense:
"Marital Vows! His Majesty's Children!"
Huh?!

00:03:44.903 --> 00:03:46.504
A prince?

00:03:46.504 --> 00:03:47.672
Yes.

00:03:47.672 --> 00:03:52.109
His Highness Crown Prince
Bhatura the 17th of the Imparahen Kingdom.

00:03:53.278 --> 00:03:55.847
His Highness is a level 7 esper.

00:03:55.847 --> 00:04:00.919
In short, anticipating your powers,
he came here to ask for your assistance.

00:04:00.919 --> 00:04:02.053
Assistance?

00:04:02.053 --> 00:04:03.145
It's very simple.

00:04:04.322 --> 00:04:08.293
I'd like you to persuade a
certain esper in my country.

00:04:08.293 --> 00:04:09.351
Persuade?

00:04:09.894 --> 00:04:12.192
If you come with me, I will explain.

00:04:12.564 --> 00:04:13.895
Time is of the essence.

00:04:14.299 --> 00:04:16.734
Huh? We're going to Imparahen?

00:04:16.734 --> 00:04:21.239
This is a problem with concerns
Japan's national interests as well.

00:04:21.239 --> 00:04:24.609
While the Imparahen Kingdom
is the world's smallest nation,

00:04:24.609 --> 00:04:27.745
it's the largest exporter of
rare earth metals to us.

00:04:27.745 --> 00:04:29.269
Not to be difficult or anything...

00:04:30.481 --> 00:04:32.483
but please do as I say.

00:04:32.483 --> 00:04:34.508
Or we'll stop exporting, you son of a bitch.

00:04:35.353 --> 00:04:38.289
You speak softly, but play
hardball with your diplomacy.

00:04:38.289 --> 00:04:40.291
So, that's how it is.

00:04:40.291 --> 00:04:44.694
Honestly, there are a number of elements
about this mission that concern me...

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:49.161
We will give you riches, land,
or even the titles of princess in return!

00:04:49.334 --> 00:04:51.302
I beg you to help us in our hour of need!

00:04:51.302 --> 00:04:52.428
Princesses?

00:04:53.171 --> 00:04:54.729
I can't allow this!

00:04:54.872 --> 00:04:57.642
Of course we'll help a friendly nation!

00:04:57.642 --> 00:05:00.245
Right! Right! It's, um... Mutual assistance!

00:05:00.245 --> 00:05:03.414
He's kind of low-class,
but please pay him no mind!

00:05:03.414 --> 00:05:07.252
Are you sure we should have
let the director set this up?

00:05:07.252 --> 00:05:09.982
Well, she's going with them, so...

00:05:11.122 --> 00:05:14.325
The ratio of hot guys to women
in Imparahen is really high!

00:05:14.325 --> 00:05:16.294
Now I just need to get a spa treatment.

00:05:16.294 --> 00:05:19.664
Can you get me some exclusive
cosmetics from the duty free shop?

00:05:19.664 --> 00:05:21.933
In that case, I'd like some Nannel perfume!

00:05:21.933 --> 00:05:23.764
Okay! Okay!

00:05:24.902 --> 00:05:26.971
My unease only grows!

00:05:26.971 --> 00:05:27.835
Yeah...

00:05:46.291 --> 00:05:47.553
For crying out loud!

00:05:47.759 --> 00:05:51.320
Don't they understand? This is important!

00:05:51.696 --> 00:05:54.790
And what does he mean by
"persuading an esper"?

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:58.303
If this turns dangerous,
the Japanese government...

00:05:58.303 --> 00:06:00.931
might not be able to intervene
for diplomatic reasons.

00:06:01.472 --> 00:06:02.640
Not to mention...

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:05.131
At this rate, they're turning from
national treasures into a national threat.

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:07.675
The Children will be fine.

00:06:08.313 --> 00:06:09.075
Director.

00:06:09.547 --> 00:06:13.176
I'm more reliable to have than
an escort fleet and bombers.

00:06:13.685 --> 00:06:15.915
I had an acquaintance here, once upon a time.

00:06:16.888 --> 00:06:17.820
However...

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:19.657
However?

00:06:19.657 --> 00:06:22.193
The problem here is that the
prince totally outclasses you...

00:06:22.193 --> 00:06:24.162
in the money, status, and looks department!

00:06:24.162 --> 00:06:24.829
Huh?!

00:06:24.829 --> 00:06:25.730
Don't lose!

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:27.665
Don't let him get a hold of The Childrens' hearts!

00:06:27.665 --> 00:06:30.101
Get into this tuxedo!
Use this pheromone cologne!

00:06:30.101 --> 00:06:32.001
I don't need pheromones to escort children!

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:33.760
They practice polygamy here!

00:06:33.905 --> 00:06:36.240
And there's no age limit on
marriage in the royal family!

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:39.607
Those girls could actually end up as princesses!

00:06:40.044 --> 00:06:41.807
This is why I hate this woman.

00:06:43.014 --> 00:06:43.915
Granny!

00:06:43.915 --> 00:06:44.847
Mr. Minamoto!

00:06:45.983 --> 00:06:47.007
Oh, my!

00:06:48.786 --> 00:06:50.481
So, how does it look?

00:06:51.255 --> 00:06:53.382
You two are adorable!

00:06:54.125 --> 00:06:55.649
Hey! Come on, Kaoru!

00:06:55.993 --> 00:06:57.929
I'm not ready for this!

00:06:57.929 --> 00:06:59.396
I've never worn anything like this before...

00:07:00.231 --> 00:07:01.799
Hair extensions!

00:07:01.799 --> 00:07:04.602
The prince's personal hair
stylist put them on her!

00:07:04.602 --> 00:07:07.805
He said he wanted us
treated like real princesses.

00:07:07.805 --> 00:07:10.103
H-How do you like it, Minamoto?

00:07:11.175 --> 00:07:13.143
Yeah... It looks nice.

00:07:13.544 --> 00:07:16.479
I was just a little surprised.
I just see you as young girls, so...

00:07:16.848 --> 00:07:18.483
We're not playing dress-up!

00:07:18.483 --> 00:07:19.751
Idiot.

00:07:19.751 --> 00:07:23.619
It's easy to hurt a girl's heart.
Watch what you say.

00:07:24.555 --> 00:07:28.685
B-But... You don't really prefer being
princesses to having Minamoto, right?

00:07:29.627 --> 00:07:30.992
Well...

00:07:31.829 --> 00:07:33.197
The thing about girls...

00:07:33.197 --> 00:07:36.768
is that they're happier being
loved than to just love, right?

00:07:36.768 --> 00:07:38.736
It's different if someone can stop our tears.

00:07:38.803 --> 00:07:41.105
Start stopping their tears, right now!

00:07:41.105 --> 00:07:44.776
Could you please not play along
with their childish games?!

00:07:44.776 --> 00:07:45.504
Darn it!

00:07:47.612 --> 00:07:49.807
So, here you are.

00:07:50.248 --> 00:07:52.716
You're the espers Bhatura brought here?

00:07:55.753 --> 00:07:56.481
Are you okay?!

00:07:57.955 --> 00:07:58.853
How impudent.

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:03.592
You thought you could restrain me,
since you're Level 7's, too?

00:08:04.095 --> 00:08:05.196
"Too"?

00:08:05.196 --> 00:08:06.561
A Level 7?!

00:08:07.365 --> 00:08:09.033
An energy mass.

00:08:09.033 --> 00:08:10.898
Is she using psychokinesis to attack with it?

00:08:11.569 --> 00:08:13.400
But she also just teleported!

00:08:13.938 --> 00:08:17.074
I don't know what's going on here,
but we'll take you on!

00:08:17.074 --> 00:08:18.276
Kaoru, wait!

00:08:18.276 --> 00:08:20.471
Then fight me and die!

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:23.514
You!

00:08:23.514 --> 00:08:25.316
It's been a while, Masala.

00:08:25.316 --> 00:08:26.943
Huh? You know her, Granny?

00:08:27.018 --> 00:08:28.918
Even now, you're still...

00:08:30.421 --> 00:08:32.184
ticklish down here?

00:08:34.826 --> 00:08:37.624
Agh! Fujiko! Don't! Stop!

00:08:38.229 --> 00:08:39.864
Stop that!

00:08:39.864 --> 00:08:41.491
What are you doing in front of children?!

00:08:42.033 --> 00:08:46.231
God, I knew it was you as
soon as I saw your powers.

00:08:46.704 --> 00:08:50.341
But you looked different 50 years ago.

00:08:50.341 --> 00:08:51.740
By any chance, are you?

00:08:51.809 --> 00:08:55.079
Yes, Fujiko, dear. I am now...

00:08:55.079 --> 00:08:56.068
Grandmother!

00:08:56.581 --> 00:08:59.379
Please don't possess anyone
outside of the barrier!

00:08:59.817 --> 00:09:01.375
Great. It's the killjoy.

00:09:02.553 --> 00:09:04.350
You're dead, is that clear?!

00:09:05.756 --> 00:09:07.018
I knew it.

00:09:08.259 --> 00:09:09.226
Allow me to explain.

00:09:10.828 --> 00:09:15.891
The Imparahen Kingdom has used ESP
to maintain itself since ancient times.

00:09:16.968 --> 00:09:19.403
We're a small nation, and the way we keep...

00:09:19.403 --> 00:09:22.240
from being absorbed into
the neighboring empires...

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:26.301
is by using our esper shrine maidens
as advisors to the royal family.

00:09:27.011 --> 00:09:28.478
Along with something else.

00:09:30.014 --> 00:09:32.107
It's thanks to the Sage's Statue.

00:09:32.917 --> 00:09:35.086
This is crystallized rare earth metals!

00:09:35.086 --> 00:09:35.643
Yes.

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:37.949
And it possesses a strange power.

00:09:38.623 --> 00:09:40.892
The soul of an esper who dies on that throne...

00:09:40.892 --> 00:09:43.793
takes up residence in the statue,
living on after death.

00:09:44.328 --> 00:09:48.697
You mean that statue is full of the souls
of generations of esper shrine maidens.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:51.736
G-Ghosts?! It's full of ghosts?!

00:09:51.736 --> 00:09:55.540
No. Similar, but not quite the same.

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:57.441
It's called residual thought.

00:09:57.441 --> 00:10:00.501
Which means, of course,
that Masala is in there, too.

00:10:03.881 --> 00:10:07.214
My grandmother. She died 20 years ago.

00:10:08.252 --> 00:10:09.453
I see.

00:10:09.453 --> 00:10:12.223
A psychometrist could draw her
out just by touching it, right?

00:10:12.223 --> 00:10:15.493
No! I'll touch a psycho killer's
weapon or lost articles,

00:10:15.493 --> 00:10:17.688
but I absolutely will not touch a ghost!

00:10:17.995 --> 00:10:19.196
What's the difference?

00:10:19.196 --> 00:10:19.924
I get it.

00:10:20.565 --> 00:10:22.867
You're saying Masala has possessed...

00:10:22.867 --> 00:10:25.859
the body of a powerful esper shrine maiden?

00:10:26.103 --> 00:10:27.338
Exactly!

00:10:27.338 --> 00:10:29.740
And because of it, my Sera is!

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:31.002
"My Sera"?

00:10:31.409 --> 00:10:32.637
The name of this body.

00:10:33.411 --> 00:10:35.680
A Level 7 psychometrist.

00:10:35.680 --> 00:10:39.317
Thanks to her, I was able
to revive, as you can see.

00:10:39.317 --> 00:10:42.587
Not to mention bringing to life the powers...

00:10:42.587 --> 00:10:46.148
of all the espers inhabiting the Sage's Statue.

00:10:48.292 --> 00:10:50.226
Please release me, Grandmother!

00:10:52.029 --> 00:10:53.018
What's wrong?

00:10:55.833 --> 00:10:57.733
Sera! Sera, is it you?!

00:10:58.369 --> 00:10:59.131
Your Highness!

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:00.471
Your Highness!

00:11:00.471 --> 00:11:01.572
Sera!

00:11:01.572 --> 00:11:03.437
I've brought powerful espers from Japan!

00:11:04.375 --> 00:11:08.579
They'll be able to persuade my
grandmother and you'll be saved!

00:11:08.579 --> 00:11:11.215
Then I just need to be patient a bit longer.

00:11:11.215 --> 00:11:12.917
I love you, Sera!

00:11:12.917 --> 00:11:15.317
And I love you, Your Highness.

00:11:15.553 --> 00:11:16.417
Thump! Thump!

00:11:17.822 --> 00:11:20.347
What do you two think you're doing?!

00:11:20.758 --> 00:11:23.761
The law forbids royalty from
marrying a shrine maiden!

00:11:23.761 --> 00:11:25.991
Didn't I tell you to obey the law?!

00:11:26.063 --> 00:11:26.995
Damn it!

00:11:27.531 --> 00:11:31.636
Oh, come on, they're in love.
Can't you let them do it?

00:11:31.636 --> 00:11:34.171
I refuse! The law is absolute!

00:11:34.171 --> 00:11:36.774
Take it from someone with life experience!

00:11:36.774 --> 00:11:39.140
This sort of infatuation is short-lived!

00:11:39.877 --> 00:11:42.505
Espers and Normals!
Royalty and shrine maidens!

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:44.448
They live in different worlds!

00:11:44.448 --> 00:11:47.315
Besides, Sera is older than him!

00:11:47.918 --> 00:11:50.386
No! I won't give up!

00:11:51.722 --> 00:11:55.793
Then according to ancient law,
you must fight me.

00:11:55.793 --> 00:11:57.361
Huh? Fight?

00:11:57.361 --> 00:12:00.387
I shall fight the espers chosen by the prince!

00:12:04.101 --> 00:12:05.903
I won't let you sleep tonight.

00:12:05.903 --> 00:12:07.427
I won't sleep tonight.

00:12:09.674 --> 00:12:10.941
Tell us more!

00:12:10.941 --> 00:12:12.841
Very well. Come with me.

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:15.279
Fight The Children?

00:12:15.279 --> 00:12:17.648
Any time, Grandma!

00:12:17.648 --> 00:12:20.351
Hold it! No one said anything about this!

00:12:20.351 --> 00:12:23.411
You said you just wanted them to persuade her!

00:12:26.123 --> 00:12:27.249
Interesting.

00:12:27.758 --> 00:12:30.628
Basically, if we win, they get to go out, right?

00:12:30.628 --> 00:12:31.720
Hey! What are you?

00:12:31.962 --> 00:12:34.726
Minamoto, this mission is incredibly vital!

00:12:35.199 --> 00:12:37.429
It'll be fine! Trust us!

00:12:38.469 --> 00:12:40.671
Mr. Minamoto, release our limiters, already!

00:12:40.671 --> 00:12:42.332
Okay. Understood.

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:43.807
The Children...

00:12:45.209 --> 00:12:46.107
Released!

00:12:46.243 --> 00:12:46.709
<<RELEASED>>

00:12:49.213 --> 00:12:52.950
When you really love someone, status,
position, and age difference don't matter!

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:55.619
We'll help you to overcome those obstacles!

00:12:55.619 --> 00:12:58.622
We'll fight for your freedom to love!

00:12:58.622 --> 00:13:00.590
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:13:01.992 --> 00:13:04.261
L-Let's consider the age
difference thing, though...

00:13:04.261 --> 00:13:04.920
Quiet!

00:13:05.963 --> 00:13:07.294
This has gotten interesting.

00:13:07.932 --> 00:13:09.695
All right, into the barrier, then!

00:13:17.775 --> 00:13:20.311
ESP waves resonate with the rare earth metals...

00:13:20.311 --> 00:13:22.813
within the barrier, amplifying their power.

00:13:22.813 --> 00:13:25.509
Physical appearance changes in
proportion to the power increase.

00:13:26.584 --> 00:13:28.518
Don't look so worried, Minamoto.

00:13:28.886 --> 00:13:30.786
We're not going to lose.

00:13:31.722 --> 00:13:33.591
No, that's not it.

00:13:33.591 --> 00:13:35.923
By the way, they can't see the change.

00:13:36.393 --> 00:13:39.830
So, at least their power equals
that of an adult, huh?

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:41.565
Then, let's begin.

00:13:41.565 --> 00:13:45.592
But considering the three on
one handicap I have...

00:13:49.473 --> 00:13:51.065
I'm calling in some helpers!

00:13:52.343 --> 00:13:52.934
Retreat!

00:13:53.711 --> 00:13:55.112
Fools.

00:13:55.112 --> 00:13:58.570
It's simple to predict where you'll
appear on a field as small as this!

00:13:58.849 --> 00:13:59.483
Take this!

00:13:59.483 --> 00:14:00.472
No, you don't!

00:14:02.153 --> 00:14:04.178
No fair! You have the advantage!

00:14:04.922 --> 00:14:08.449
Oh, well, why not have dear Fujiko help you out?

00:14:08.626 --> 00:14:09.991
Huh? Me?!

00:14:10.194 --> 00:14:12.424
Director, please!

00:14:13.964 --> 00:14:17.559
I step into the barrier, it'll amplify my powers
and my appearance will change in proportion.

00:14:19.303 --> 00:14:20.905
My appearance...

00:14:20.905 --> 00:14:22.373
No! I can't!

00:14:22.373 --> 00:14:23.941
Come on, you didn't change that much!

00:14:23.941 --> 00:14:27.511
No! My skin tone changed!
I don't want my face or breasts in there!

00:14:27.511 --> 00:14:28.445
You... Why did you even come?!

00:14:28.445 --> 00:14:30.504
Then please use these!
You... Why did you even come?!

00:14:35.052 --> 00:14:38.122
They can transform your psychic attacks!

00:14:38.122 --> 00:14:40.750
Just please try not to hurt Sera's body!

00:14:41.892 --> 00:14:43.727
Don't worry about that.

00:14:43.727 --> 00:14:47.060
There's no way you can ever harm me!

00:14:47.331 --> 00:14:48.365
What?!

00:14:48.365 --> 00:14:49.867
You'll regret that.

00:14:49.867 --> 00:14:51.858
Okay, I'll start!

00:14:52.536 --> 00:14:54.163
Teleport Arrow!

00:14:59.276 --> 00:15:00.368
Now it's my turn.

00:15:01.345 --> 00:15:03.747
Lightweight Damascus steel saber.

00:15:03.747 --> 00:15:06.016
Forged: 308 BC.

00:15:06.016 --> 00:15:08.007
Popularly known as a "shamshir".

00:15:09.253 --> 00:15:11.881
Method of use... Completely scanned!

00:15:17.428 --> 00:15:19.296
We'll handle the cannon fodder!

00:15:19.296 --> 00:15:21.799
Kaoru, take care of the old lady!

00:15:21.799 --> 00:15:23.733
All right!

00:15:29.206 --> 00:15:31.299
Well, you're not half bad!

00:15:35.045 --> 00:15:36.747
Please do your best!

00:15:36.747 --> 00:15:39.079
If you beat my grandma and let me marry Sera,

00:15:39.149 --> 00:15:42.286
I'll double our rare earth metal exports to Japan!

00:15:42.286 --> 00:15:43.621
Amazing.

00:15:43.621 --> 00:15:46.090
We've never even taught them that.

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:48.991
They grow each day, even if we do nothing.

00:15:49.994 --> 00:15:52.519
They won't be little kids forever.

00:15:52.997 --> 00:15:56.694
If you aren't careful, "that future"
will be here before you know it.

00:16:08.712 --> 00:16:12.016
So get 'em while you've got 'em!
Don't worry about the age difference!

00:16:12.016 --> 00:16:12.607
Shut up!

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:17.245
Kaoru!

00:16:19.156 --> 00:16:20.224
Wait, please!

00:16:20.224 --> 00:16:20.918
Kaoru!

00:16:22.726 --> 00:16:23.527
Kaoru!

00:16:23.527 --> 00:16:24.926
Kaoru, are you all right?

00:16:25.429 --> 00:16:26.623
She just grazed me!

00:16:29.033 --> 00:16:32.970
This field uses ESP to modify what you see.

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:33.994
I see.

00:16:34.772 --> 00:16:38.731
Fine! I never needed weapons in the first place!

00:16:42.579 --> 00:16:44.376
Let's just see how this goes a little longer.

00:16:44.815 --> 00:16:46.750
We can stop them if it goes badly.

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:47.216
Right.

00:16:47.885 --> 00:16:49.580
This is good enough.

00:16:53.324 --> 00:16:56.727
If worse come to worst,
my ambush troops will stop the old lady!

00:16:56.727 --> 00:16:57.828
Ooh! Dirty!

00:16:57.828 --> 00:17:00.319
Isn't that kind of... cheating?

00:17:00.564 --> 00:17:02.433
Don't be so naive!

00:17:02.433 --> 00:17:04.264
This is like a coup d'etat!

00:17:04.802 --> 00:17:08.939
Sometimes you have no choice in how
to fight to protect what you love!

00:17:08.939 --> 00:17:09.997
Am I wrong?

00:17:10.941 --> 00:17:14.138
For Sera's sake, I'll gladly dirty my hands!

00:17:14.945 --> 00:17:17.072
Even if I make the whole world my enemy!

00:17:19.183 --> 00:17:22.186
Those rings won't hit me,
no matter how many you fire!

00:17:22.186 --> 00:17:24.416
Come at me with something more direct!

00:17:25.222 --> 00:17:27.257
Don't get carried away.

00:17:27.257 --> 00:17:29.953
I told you... I'm also a Level 7!

00:17:34.631 --> 00:17:38.268
She's the same as me? No... Stronger?

00:17:38.268 --> 00:17:39.303
She's pushing me back!

00:17:39.303 --> 00:17:40.237
Kaoru!

00:17:40.237 --> 00:17:41.271
Kaoru!

00:17:41.271 --> 00:17:42.602
That's enough, Kaoru!

00:17:43.374 --> 00:17:46.043
If you both keep blasting your powers like that,

00:17:46.043 --> 00:17:48.068
the loser will end up blown to pieces!

00:17:48.812 --> 00:17:51.248
This fight isn't worth risking your life over!

00:17:51.248 --> 00:17:53.113
Back off!

00:17:53.851 --> 00:17:54.545
You're wrong!

00:17:55.719 --> 00:17:59.086
We take... We take every fight seriously!

00:17:59.923 --> 00:18:04.326
So quit calling us kids!
Quit telling us to back off!

00:18:05.229 --> 00:18:08.632
Quit saying Espers and Normals
live in different worlds!

00:18:08.632 --> 00:18:11.969
Quit talking about the difference in ages!

00:18:11.969 --> 00:18:12.765
You...

00:18:13.937 --> 00:18:15.239
Exactly!

00:18:15.239 --> 00:18:16.501
Get her, Kaoru!

00:18:28.752 --> 00:18:30.220
Her power's blazing!

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:32.120
The barrier's breaking!

00:18:32.823 --> 00:18:34.024
This is bad.

00:18:34.024 --> 00:18:37.391
If it breaks, they may take out the palace,
or even the whole city!

00:18:37.528 --> 00:18:40.364
Dammit... I have no choice now!

00:18:40.364 --> 00:18:43.167
Elders from history, lend me your strength!

00:18:43.167 --> 00:18:45.465
Um, no. How about you just quit, okay?

00:18:45.669 --> 00:18:46.403
Huh?!

00:18:46.403 --> 00:18:47.271
We heard everything.

00:18:47.271 --> 00:18:48.172
They're in love! Give them a break!
We heard everything.

00:18:48.172 --> 00:18:49.873
That prince is so sexy!
If I was 300 years younger...
They're in love! Give them a break!
It's wrong to interfere with young people in love!

00:18:49.873 --> 00:18:50.874
That prince is so sexy!
If I was 300 years younger...
It's wrong to interfere with young people in love!

00:18:50.874 --> 00:18:52.774
That prince is so sexy!
If I was 300 years younger...

00:18:52.876 --> 00:18:54.545
What are you saying?!

00:18:54.545 --> 00:18:56.809
Everyone agrees.

00:18:57.414 --> 00:18:59.249
You, the previous generation,
are the only one who objects.

00:18:59.249 --> 00:19:00.918
Please, allow this!

00:19:00.918 --> 00:19:03.648
You... You... You can't be serious!

00:19:04.121 --> 00:19:05.622
STOP!

00:19:05.622 --> 00:19:06.857
It's come to this, huh?

00:19:06.857 --> 00:19:09.018
Hey girls, no matter how much they like you,

00:19:09.093 --> 00:19:11.186
if you come on too strong,
a man's gonna pull back.

00:19:11.862 --> 00:19:15.799
You make yourself appealing
when they want to protect you!

00:19:15.799 --> 00:19:17.926
Sh-She's right!

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:21.672
Oh, I'm finished!

00:19:21.672 --> 00:19:23.273
I'm just a girl, after all!

00:19:23.273 --> 00:19:24.341
Kaoru?

00:19:24.341 --> 00:19:25.642
Take care of this.

00:19:25.642 --> 00:19:26.734
You, double-crossing!

00:19:27.444 --> 00:19:30.379
Okay, gotta think of a ladylike
way to win. Ladylike...

00:19:31.548 --> 00:19:34.685
Right here. That's your tickle
spot, right, big sister?

00:19:34.685 --> 00:19:35.552
She did it!

00:19:35.552 --> 00:19:37.988
I name that the "Adult Lady Strategy"!

00:19:37.988 --> 00:19:40.057
No, it is SO not that...

00:19:40.057 --> 00:19:41.615
Whoever gave them that impression?

00:19:42.593 --> 00:19:46.154
Aoi! These things are linked to her!

00:19:48.432 --> 00:19:49.399
I see.

00:19:49.399 --> 00:19:52.027
If I shoot the statue, it'll break her psychic link!

00:19:52.569 --> 00:19:55.629
No! Wait! That's our nation's precious heritage!

00:19:57.141 --> 00:19:59.336
Coup d'etat, complete.

00:20:02.312 --> 00:20:06.917
Okay, riddle me this: what do you call a
sport where you go through arches?

00:20:06.917 --> 00:20:08.441
Archery!

00:20:09.219 --> 00:20:10.311
Are we done here?

00:20:11.121 --> 00:20:18.425
The young can destroy traditions
and laws whenever they like.

00:20:19.163 --> 00:20:23.759
So why don't we give them the
power to write their own future?

00:20:26.637 --> 00:20:27.729
I hear you.

00:20:29.006 --> 00:20:31.167
Do what you want.

00:20:34.478 --> 00:20:35.069
I...

00:20:35.879 --> 00:20:37.972
Sera... Is that you?

00:20:38.415 --> 00:20:39.211
Your Highness!

00:20:40.751 --> 00:20:41.485
Sera!

00:20:41.485 --> 00:20:42.281
Your Highness!

00:20:45.689 --> 00:20:48.157
Look well and learn from this.

00:20:48.559 --> 00:20:49.992
Huh? Where's Kaoru?

00:20:50.861 --> 00:20:51.828
Minamoto!

00:20:58.368 --> 00:21:00.063
Look! I beat her!

00:21:01.872 --> 00:21:03.897
Do you admit that I'm a little more mature now?

00:21:05.809 --> 00:21:07.436
You girls...

00:21:10.013 --> 00:21:12.049
Okay! Quit hogging him for yourself!

00:21:12.049 --> 00:21:13.884
No end runs, right?

00:21:13.884 --> 00:21:16.220
Oh, come on! What's the big deal?

00:21:16.220 --> 00:21:20.490
Mr. Minamoto, you like me more than
Kaoru the power gorilla, right?

00:21:20.490 --> 00:21:21.758
What did you call me?!

00:21:21.758 --> 00:21:23.894
Stop it, you two.

00:21:23.894 --> 00:21:25.729
Come on, no fighting!

00:21:25.729 --> 00:21:27.497
You really are little kids.

00:21:27.497 --> 00:21:29.800
So, this is how it turns out.

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:31.859
Will they be all right?

00:21:32.502 --> 00:21:35.198
You may have broken destiny
for the prince and Sera,

00:21:35.672 --> 00:21:39.938
but our own Precogs are worried
about the future of those girls.

00:21:45.882 --> 00:21:49.215
I always loved you. I love you.

00:21:52.623 --> 00:21:56.493
Say, what is this? You keep checking on it.

00:21:56.493 --> 00:21:57.391
I suppose.

00:21:58.295 --> 00:21:59.956
Looking for any mistakes?

00:22:01.064 --> 00:22:02.429
Sort of.

00:22:02.899 --> 00:22:07.461
But for now, it's still within the margin of error.

00:22:20.784 --> 00:22:24.421
I turn to the front, embracing the dream

00:22:24.421 --> 00:22:28.392
Making up my mind, looking up to the sky

00:22:28.392 --> 00:22:34.431
I'll fly beyond the future with my wings

00:22:34.431 --> 00:22:38.335
You alone are my heart's desire!

00:22:38.335 --> 00:22:42.272
I declared that I love you absolutely

00:22:42.272 --> 00:22:48.177
As the shining seasons pass

00:22:48.912 --> 00:22:52.983
Your face is still as troubled as in

00:22:52.983 --> 00:22:56.851
The photos I took to remember those days

00:22:57.454 --> 00:23:03.689
As I shed warm, gentle tears

00:23:04.895 --> 00:23:08.465
Let's try to meet here tomorrow, too

00:23:08.465 --> 00:23:12.035
Without making promises, let's go

00:23:12.035 --> 00:23:15.972
As casually as always

00:23:15.972 --> 00:23:21.239
Waving my little hand with a smile

00:23:22.245 --> 00:23:27.046
"Bye bye, till we meet again"

00:23:40.097 --> 00:23:40.797
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:40.797 --> 00:23:41.865
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.865 --> 00:23:42.833
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:42.833 --> 00:23:45.461
So, Japan is my next playground, huh?

00:23:46.236 --> 00:23:48.138
It's a country with fun toys!

00:23:48.138 --> 00:23:51.274
This child's been eaten away to
his core by Black Phantom!

00:23:51.274 --> 00:23:53.343
This is the only way to save those two!

00:23:53.343 --> 00:23:55.746
Don't worry! I know Kaoru will come!

00:23:55.746 --> 00:23:57.680
We'll look after ourselves till she does!

00:23:58.315 --> 00:23:59.683
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:59.683 --> 00:24:02.419
Episode 42: "Combination
Complication! Fantastic Toy!"

00:24:02.419 --> 00:24:04.688
Let's go! God Fire Truck Robo Mk II!

00:24:04.688 --> 00:24:06.623
Aoi! Shiho! I'm coming!

00:24:06.623 --> 00:24:08.658
Combination Complication!
Fantastic Toy!
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.658 --> 00:24:09.818
Combination Complication!
Fantastic Toy!
